    - rid: 1123138610053513300
      type: {class: IllustrationBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: The Sunken Larder
        text: Past the great tree the dry ground gives out into planks and stumps. Smoke hangs low over the reeds. A hut leans on stilts above the black water, firelight showing through the gaps in its boards.
        continueLabel: Climb to the door
        duration: 0
        hostState: 1
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: c69509fce5964b67aa2d5aa43c3f68cb, type: 2}
        transition: 0
        motionFrom: {x: 0, y: 0}
        motionTo: {x: 0, y: 0}
        scaleFrom: 1
        scaleTo: 1
        backgroundMotionFrom: {x: 0, y: 0}
        backgroundMotionTo: {x: 0, y: 0}
        backgroundScaleFrom: 1
        backgroundScaleTo: 1
    - rid: 1123138610053513301
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: Inside
        text: Jars crowd every shelf and table, stoppered and unlabeled. Skins hang from the walls. In the corner a small cauldron simmers over the fire.
        continueLabel: Look closer
        duration: 0
        hostState: 1
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d4f3f006d42940859d52e245c667ce5b, type: 2}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513302
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: Among the jars
        text: A child's wooden horse sits among them, one leg snapped off.
        continueLabel: Step toward the fire
        duration: 0
        hostState: 1
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513303
      type: {class: ArrivalBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: By the fire
        text: An old woman stirs the pot without looking up.
        continueLabel: Wait
        duration: 0
        hostState: 1
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        hideNarrativeDuringMotion: 0
        autoAdvance: 0
    - rid: 1123138610053513304
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: The Old Woman
        text: Your traveler stood where you're standing. Wanted something I had. Paid for it, too.
        continueLabel: Ask what they wanted
        duration: 3
        hostState: 2
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513305
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: Answers cost
        text: Answers cost. What have you got?
        continueLabel: Empty your pockets
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513306
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: Nothing you'd part with
        text: She looks you over. No. Nothing you'd part with.
        continueLabel: Wait
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513307
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: A game, then
        text: We'll play, then. Win, and I'll tell you what they bought, and what it cost them.
        continueLabel: Ask about the smell
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513308
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: In here
        text: Out there, everything rots. In here, it rots when I say.
        continueLabel: Ask about the charms
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513309
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: What the larder reveals
        text: 'This bargain reveals Worn Pebble, Light Basket, and Patient Mill. Their charms reward what rot leaves behind: worn faces, a lighter load, and patient work.'
        continueLabel: Hear the terms
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513310
      type: {class: InvitationBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: The Sunken Larder
        text: The pot keeps simmering. Accept, and we begin.
        continueLabel: Accept the bargain
        duration: 0
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 11400000, guid: d1997d1b3a704205b4b34eb20c7973d8, type: 2}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
    - rid: 1123138610053513311
      type: {class: EncounterBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: 
        text: 
        continueLabel: 
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        encounter: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2149f169e85f405a885c490e78f5fc2c, type: 2}
        victoryTitle: Fair's fair.
        victoryText: She sets down the spoon and takes a jar from the highest shelf. Something inside murmurs against the glass. Their voice. That's what they paid.
        defeatTitle: Pity.
        defeatText: The fire spits. Things spoil, waiting. Sit down again when you're ready.
        abandonText: The old woman goes back to her stirring. The jars keep their secrets until the next game.
        resultContinueLabel: Return to the trail
        victoryPresentation:
          enabled: 1
          hostState: 4
          holdDuration: 0.25
          fadeDuration: 0.3
          showDialogue: 1
          artwork: {fileID: 0}
