    - rid: 1123138610053513312
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: What they bought
        text: They wanted to follow the blue light without it swallowing them. I gave them the way. Whoever they're chasing, they won't turn back now.
        continueLabel: Ask about the voice
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513313
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: A warning
        text: If you hear them calling, it isn't them.
        continueLabel: Leave the larder
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513314
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: A voice in a jar
        text: The traveler is following someone through the drowned land, by a way the old woman sold them. Their voice sits in her jar. If you hear it calling, it isn't them.
        continueLabel: 
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
        audioCue: {fileID: 0}
        progressionReward: {fileID: 0}
        scene: {fileID: 0}
        transition: 0
        charm: {fileID: 0}
    - rid: 1123138610053513315
      type: {class: DialogueBeat, ns: Dice.Presentation, asm: Dice.Presentation}
      data:
        title: Chapter 2 complete
        text: The traveler is alive, and searching for someone of their own. You know what they paid to follow. The next chapter lies beyond the drowned land.
        continueLabel: 
        duration: 1
        hostState: 0
